        "efficiency_retrofit",
        "green_equipment",
        "pollution_treatment",
        "green_rnd",
        "restoration_obligation",
        "carbon_compliance"
      ],
      "applies_when": [
        "披露金额为预算或计划投资时，不得视为已发生支出",
        "资本性支出与费用性支出分别对应不同报表项目"
